[
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_191",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Let $f(x) = 2x^3 + ax^2 + bx - 4$. It is given that $x - 2$ is a factor of $f(x)$. When $f(x)$ is divided by $x - 1$, the remainder is $-3$. Find the value of $a + b$.",
    "question_zh": "設 $f(x) = 2x^3 + ax^2 + bx - 4$。已知 $x - 2$ 是 $f(x)$ 的因式。當 $f(x)$ 除以 $x - 1$ 時，餘數為 $-3$。求 $a + b$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. -1",
      "B. -3",
      "C. -5",
      "D. -7"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "By factor theorem, $f(2) = 0$: $16 + 4a + 2b - 4 = 0$ → $2a + b = -6$ (Eq. 1).",
      "By remainder theorem, $f(1) = -3$: $2 + a + b - 4 = -3$ → $a + b = -1$ (Eq. 2).",
      "Directly from Eq. 2, $a + b = -1$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "根據因式定理，$f(2) = 0$：$16 + 4a + 2b - 4 = 0$ → $2a + b = -6$ (方程 1)。",
      "根據餘數定理，$f(1) = -3$：$2 + a + b - 4 = -3$ → $a + b = -1$ (方程 2)。",
      "直接從方程 2 得出 $a + b = -1$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_192",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_log_exp"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The graph shows a linear relation between $\\log_{4} y$ and $x$. The line passes through $(0, 1)$ and $(2, 2)$. Express $y$ in terms of $x$.",
    "question_zh": "圖中顯示 $\\log_{4} y$ 與 $x$ 之間的線性關係。該直線通過 $(0, 1)$ 及 $(2, 2)$。將 $y$ 以 $x$ 表示。",
    "options": [
      "A. $y = 4 \\cdot 2^x$",
      "B. $y = 4^x + 4$",
      "C. $y = 2 \\cdot 4^x$",
      "D. $y = 16 \\cdot 2^x$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "diagram_json": {
      "elements": [
        { "type": "line", "x1": 100, "y1": 220, "x2": 300, "y2": 100, "stroke": "#4f46e5", "strokeWidth": 2.5 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 100, "y": 220, "label": "(0, 1)", "labelDx": -35 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 300, "y": 100, "label": "(2, 2)", "labelDx": 10 },
        { "type": "line", "x1": 50, "y1": 220, "x2": 350, "y2": 220, "stroke": "#94a3b8", "strokeWidth": 1, "label": "x" },
        { "type": "line", "x1": 100, "y1": 50, "x2": 100, "y2": 250, "stroke": "#94a3b8", "strokeWidth": 1, "label": "log4 y" }
      ],
      "canvas": { "width": 400, "height": 300, "viewBox": "50 40 320 230" }
    },
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let $Y = \\log_{4} y$. Slope $m = \\frac{2 - 1}{2 - 0} = \\frac{1}{2}$.",
      "Intercept $c = 1$. So $Y = \\frac{1}{2}x + 1$.",
      "$\\log_{4} y = \\frac{1}{2}x + 1$ → $y = 4^{(1/2)x + 1} = 4 \\cdot (4^{1/2})^x = 4 \\cdot 2^x$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設 $Y = \\log_{4} y$。斜率 $m = \\frac{1}{2}$，截距 $c = 1$。",
      "方程為 $Y = \\frac{1}{2}x + 1$。",
      "$\\log_{4} y = \\frac{1}{2}x + 1$ → $y = 4^{(1/2)x + 1} = 4 \\cdot 2^x$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_193",
