    "question_zh": "圖中，$O$ 是圓心。$A$ 及 $B$ 是圓周上的點使得 $\\angle OAB = 35^\\circ$。求優角 $\\angle AOB$。",
    "options": [
      "A. 110°",
      "B. 250°",
      "C. 70°",
      "D. 290°"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "diagram_json": {
      "elements": [
        { "type": "circle", "cx": 240, "cy": 150, "r": 80, "stroke": "#334155", "fill": "rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.5)" },
        { "type": "polyline", "points": [{ "x": 194, "y": 85 }, { "x": 240, "y": 150 }, { "x": 194, "y": 215 }], "stroke": "#7c3aed", "strokeWidth": 2 },
        { "type": "line", "x1": 194, "y1": 85, "x2": 194, "y2": 215, "stroke": "#3b82f6", "strokeDasharray": "3,3" },
        { "type": "point", "x": 194, "y": 85, "label": "A", "labelDx": -15, "labelDy": -5 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 194, "y": 215, "label": "B", "labelDx": -15, "labelDy": 15 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 240, "y": 150, "label": "O", "labelDx": 15, "labelDy": 5 },
        { "type": "arc", "center": { "x": 194, "y": 85 }, "radius": 30, "startAngle": 270, "endAngle": 305.3, "label": "35°" }
      ],
      "canvas": { "width": 400, "height": 300, "viewBox": "120 50 200 200" }
    },
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "In isosceles $\\triangle OAB$, $\\angle OBA = \\angle OAB = 35^\\circ$.",
      "$\\angle AOB = 180^\\circ - 70^\\circ = 110^\\circ$.",
      "Reflex $\\angle AOB = 360^\\circ - 110^\\circ = 250^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "等腰 $\\triangle OAB$ 中，$\\angle OBA = \\angle OAB = 35^\\circ$。",
      "$\\angle AOB = 180^\\circ - 70^\\circ = 110^\\circ$。",
      "優角 $\\angle AOB = 360^\\circ - 110^\\circ = 250^\\circ$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_194",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_variations"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "It is given that $z$ is the sum of two parts, one part varies directly as $x$ and the other part varies directly as $\\sqrt{y}$. When $x = 1, y = 4, z = 10$; when $x = 2, y = 9, z = 19$. Find $z$ when $x = 3, y = 16$.",
    "question_zh": "已知 $z$ 為兩部分之和，一部分隨 $x$ 正變，另一部分隨 $\\sqrt{y}$ 正變。當 $x = 1, y = 4, z = 10$；當 $x = 2, y = 9, z = 19$。求當 $x = 3, y = 16$ 時 $z$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. 28",
      "B. 30",
      "C. 32",
      "D. 34"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let $z = k_1 x + k_2 \\sqrt{y}$.",
      "From $(1, 4, 10)$: $10 = k_1 + 2k_2$. From $(2, 9, 19)$: $19 = 2k_1 + 3k_2$.",
      "Solving gives $k_2 = 1, k_1 = 8$.",
      "When $x = 3, y = 16$: $z = 8(3) + 1(\\sqrt{16}) = 24 + 4 = 28$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設 $z = k_1 x + k_2 \\sqrt{y}$。",
      "得方程組：$10 = k_1 + 2k_2$ 及 $19 = 2k_1 + 3k_2$。",
      "解得 $k_1 = 8, k_2 = 1$。",
      "當 $x = 3, y = 16$ 時，$z = 8(3) + 1(4) = 28$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_195",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A bag contains 4 red balls and 6 white balls. If two balls are drawn one after another without replacement, find the probability that the two balls are of the same color.",
    "question_zh": "袋中有 4 個紅球及 6 個白球。若先後隨機抽出兩個球且不放回，求兩個球顏色相同的概率。",
    "options": [
      "A. 7/15",
      "B. 8/15",
      "C. 13/25",
      "D. 12/25"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "P(same color) = P(RR) + P(WW).",
      "P(RR) = $\\frac{4}{10} \\times \\frac{3}{9} = \\frac{2}{15}$. P(WW) = $\\frac{6}{10} \\times \\frac{5}{9} = \\frac{1}{3}$.",
      "Total = $\\frac{2}{15} + \\frac{5}{15} = \\frac{7}{15}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "P(同色) = P(紅紅) + P(白白)。",
      "P(紅紅) = $\\frac{4}{10} \\times \\frac{3}{9} = \\frac{2}{15}$。P(白白) = $\\frac{6}{10} \\times \\frac{5}{9} = \\frac{5}{15}$。",
      "總概率 = $\\frac{7}{15}$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
