  {
    "id": "ct_sa_197",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_apgp", "math_num_percentages"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The profit of a shop in the first year was HKD 800,000. Each year, the profit increases by 10% of the profit in the previous year.\n(a) Find the profit in the 4th year. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the total profit in the first 8 years. (4 marks)\n(c) After how many years will the total profit exceed HKD 15,000,000? (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "某商店首年的發展利潤為 HKD 800,000。每年，利潤較前一年增加 10%。\n(a) 求第 4 年的利潤。(4分)\n(b) 求首 8 年的總利潤。(4分)\n(c) 多少年後總利潤會超過 HKD 15,000,000？(4分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $T_4 = 800,000(1.1)^3 = 1,064,800$.",
      "(b) $S_8 = \\frac{800,000(1.1^8 - 1)}{0.1} = 9,148,710$.",
      "(c) $\\frac{800,000(1.1^n - 1)}{0.1} > 15,000,000 \\Rightarrow 1.1^n > 2.875$.",
      "$n > \\frac{\\log 2.875}{\\log 1.1} \\approx 11.08 \\Rightarrow n = 12$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 第 4 年利潤 = $800,000(1.1)^3 = 1,064,800$。",
      "(b) 總利潤 = $\\frac{800,000(1.1^8 - 1)}{0.1} = 9,148,710$。",
      "(c) $1.1^n > 2.875 \\Rightarrow n > 11.08 \\Rightarrow n = 12$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_198",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_circle_eq", "math_geo_coord"],
    "marks": 14,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Points $A(0, 0)$ and $B(6, 0)$ are given. A point $P(x, y)$ moves such that $PA : PB = 2 : 1$.\n(a) Find the equation of the locus of $P$. (6 marks)\n(b) Describe the geometric relationship of the locus. (2 marks)\n(c) Find the area of the circle formed by the locus. (6 marks)",
    "question_zh": "已知點 $A(0, 0)$ 及點 $B(6, 0)$。點 $P(x, y)$ 在移動時滿足 $PA : PB = 2 : 1$。\n(a) 求 $P$ 的軌跡方程。(6分)\n(b) 描述該軌跡的幾何關係。(2分)\n(c) 求該軌跡形成的圓的面積。(6分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $PA^2 = 4PB^2 \\Rightarrow x^2 + y^2 = 4[(x-6)^2 + y^2]$.",
      "Simplifies to $3x^2 + 3y^2 - 48x + 144 = 0$ or $x^2 + y^2 - 16x + 48 = 0$.",
      "(b) A circle center $(8, 0)$ radius 4.",
      "(c) Area = $\\pi (4^2) = 16\\pi$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $x^2 + y^2 = 4[(x-6)^2 + y^2] \\Rightarrow x^2 + y^2 - 16x + 48 = 0$。",
      "(b) 軌跡為圓心在 $(8, 0)$、半徑為 4 的圓。",
      "(c) 面積 = $16\\pi$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
