    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "For the test scores [60, 62, 65, 70, 72, 75, 78, 80, 85, 93]:\n(a) Find mean and standard deviation. (4 marks)\n(b) If scores 40 and 60 join, change in range and S.D.? (3 marks)\n(c) If scores increase by 5 then double, new mean and S.D.? (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "對於得分 [60, 62, 65, 70, 72, 75, 78, 80, 85, 93]：\n(a) 求平均數及標準差。(4分)\n(b) 若加入 40 及 60 分，全距及標準差的變化？(3分)\n(c) 若得分增加 5 分然後再增一倍，求新的平均數及標準差。(4分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Mean = 74, S.D. $\\approx 9.79$.",
      "(b) Range from 33 to 53 (increases); S.D. increases.",
      "(c) New Mean = $(74+5) \\times 2 = 158$; New S.D. = $9.79 \\times 2 = 19.58$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 平均數 = 74，標準差 $\\approx 9.79$。",
      "(b) 全距增加；標準差增加。",
      "(c) 新平均數 = 158；新標準差 = 19.58。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  }
